        /// [`as_ref`](Self::as_ref) and [`as_mut`](Self::as_mut), and may be a `static`. The
        /// handles lend the integer as an [`AtomicI64`] through
        /// [`val`](Atomic64Ref::val).
        ///
        /// Wraps `st::git_atomic64`
